"Corresponding Source" means all the source code needed to generate, install, and run the Modified Version, including build scripts, configuration files, and installation instructions, but excluding system libraries and general-purpose tools not part of the Software.

This requirement applies even if You are using the Software for Personal Use, as long as third parties can interact with it through a network.

EXEMPTIONS:
